But I'm not special.

756
00:43:42,130 --> 00:43:45,300
I never saved Gypsy.

757
00:43:45,300 --> 00:43:48,180
Gypsy saved me.

758
00:43:50,690 --> 00:43:54,360
I was born to be your mama.

759
00:43:54,360 --> 00:43:58,040
I carried you into this world,

760
00:43:58,040 --> 00:44:01,210
